{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Goobies 2 is a third-person, co-op roguelike where you battle  blobs and bosses while traversing through the Blobverse. Uncover secrets, unlock stuff, build unique builds and splatter blobs.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3565090/extras/c9c89ff3475f4b6b9cb926274f1d05eb.poster.avif?t=1765361253\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3565090/extras/c9c89ff3475f4b6b9cb926274f1d05eb.webm?t=1765361253\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3565090/extras/c9c89ff3475f4b6b9cb926274f1d05eb.mp4?t=1765361253\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Goobies come in all shapes and forms, each with unique abilities and playstyles. Choose from the original goobies or discover new beings of goo!<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3565090/extras/7b716fab6530fa33be96d4414ddf9b39.poster.avif?t=1765361253\" width=800 height=370 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3565090/extras/7b716fab6530fa33be96d4414ddf9b39.webm?t=1765361253\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3565090/extras/7b716fab6530fa33be96d4414ddf9b39.mp4?t=1765361253\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Equip yourself with mutated genes. Each gene is unique and behaves differently, some are even sentient and have a will of their own! Find new powerful synergies that have yet to be discovered by combining them in the gene pool. <br> <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3565090/extras/8e5ea10dfd5aa5594ef506b80ce5f9be.poster.avif?t=1765361253\" width=800 height=420 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3565090/extras/8e5ea10dfd5aa5594ef506b80ce5f9be.webm?t=1765361253\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3565090/extras/8e5ea10dfd5aa5594ef506b80ce5f9be.mp4?t=1765361253\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>Discover powerful Omens that evolve with new properties as they grow in number. Does your build call for an Echoing Hole or a Prickly Meteorite?\u00a0<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3565090/extras/f39f3c8abb05daa1c340ddaca147b4a5.avif?t=1765361253\" width=800 height=200 /></span></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3565090?t=1765361253","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3565090/2b78adeadfa50a834a721d11804cc0edbe542c7e/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1765361253","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3565090/4aaf5f1aea45018cc2fb97e5cdee0fda6efca3f4/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1765361253","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3565090/4aaf5f1aea45018cc2fb97e5cdee0fda6efca3f4/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1765361253","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"description":"Online Co-op","id":38},{"description":"LAN Co-op","id":48},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Camera Comfort","id":67},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Playable without 